  "patchSetVersion": 6,
  "note": "Six T3 anchors. Terminal::with_options performs the fallible semantic handshake during startup and installs a clone-aware lifecycle guard; final Terminal drop drains the bounded publisher so a short one-frame process cannot exit ahead of an admitted snapshot or fatal. Frame render calls report semantics; Backend supplies a fail-closed same-writer marker contract; and apply_buffer_with_cursor only validates, encodes and admits a revision after Backend::flush. The separately pinned ratatui-crossterm implementation writes the returned marker through its exact W. All probe calls remain behind #[cfg(feature = \"std\")].",
